moment years later looking at it retroactively&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:40.160
you know I have a lot of interest in science&nbsp;
just a huge science geek I love history and I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:46.480
love music and of course visual art and I&nbsp;
