cut to music so so just the rhythm of it and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:42.720
so all of those things converging it just made&nbsp;
me realize I'm not I'm not a spiritual person but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:48.320
